OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Feasing away tonight and skies
OL,7,Fgradually clearing. A mild, rather
OL,8,Fmuggy night under the cloud at first,
OL,9,Fbut turning a little chillier by dawn
OL,10,Fin the north, as cloud increasingly
OL,11,Fclears..
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FDry on Sunday with some patchy
OL,14,Fcloud to start. Increasing amounts of
OL,15,Fsunshine through the afternoon with
OL,16,Flighter winds. Pleasant in the
OL,17,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
